{
  "slug": "inertialai",
  "name": "Inertialai",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Embed and analyze sensor and time-series data using the InertialAI API. Provides MCP tools for embedding, similarity search, and nearest-neighbor classification, plus workflow skills for IMU session analysis, anomaly detection, and session comparison. Embeddings are stored locally and referenced by handle so high-dimensional vectors never enter the model's context window.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `analyze-imu-session` (Embed and explore a session of IMU / accelerometer / gyroscope time-series data using the InertialAI API), `compare-sessions` (Compare two time-series sessions (e.g), `find-anomalies` (Detect anomalous windows in a time-series session by embedding and ranking by distance from the rest of the…), `setup` (Diagnose and guide InertialAI API key setup)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `inertialai`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install inertialai@claude-community` from `InertialAI/claude-plugin` (`plugins/inertialai`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
